completions_0:
Sophia gave Jack 1/5 of her $100. To find this amount, we calculate (1/5) * $100 = $20.

Jack initially had $100.  Sophia gave him $20.  Therefore, Jack now has $100 + $20 = $120.

\boxed{120}

